      "description": "The intermediate representation asserts that the donation is not made through Payroll Giving (E09), but the customer scenario does not specify the method of payment. The evidence is silent on whether the £260 payment was made via Payroll Giving. Thus, this proposition cannot be confirmed, and the intermediate representation incorrectly treats it as established.",
