      "description": "The intermediate representation assumes the donation does not provide a benefit over a certain limit, but the scenario does not describe any benefit received by Robyn Ellis. The policy (E11) prohibits donations where the donor receives a benefit over a certain limit, but the threshold and nature of such a benefit are undefined. Without evidence about the benefit or its magnitude, the status of this condition is unknowable.",
