      ],
      "description": "The intermediate representation includes a proposition about the donor's tax position, but the customer scenario provides no information about Robyn Ellis's tax liability in the relevant tax year. The policy (E04) requires that the donor has paid at least as much in tax as the amount claimed, but this fact is unverified and thus cannot be used to establish eligibility.",
